'''Zyclone''' (アンデッドサイクロン, ''Andeddo Saikuron'', '''Undead Cyclone''') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] introduced in [[Unholy Tempest (Insane)|The Rolling Dead]]. He was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Zyclone
|image = E 294.png
|first appearance = [[Unholy Tempest (Insane)|The Rolling Dead]]<br>
'''ZL''': [[Broadleaf Yo-Yo|Sub-chapter 18 - Broadleaf Yo-yo]]
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
}}

==Enemy==
Like most [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s, Zyclone is slow and short-ranged, but has unmatched attack rate, health, and DPS. He revives infinitely with 4 seconds between revives, but can't burrow, and isn't a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy either.

==Strategy==
It is suggested to use crowd-controllers and ranged attackers, just like against the other Cyclones. Some of the most accessible options for crowd-control include [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Gardener Cat]], [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Welterweight Cat]] and [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Vaulter Cat]]. However, since this Cyclone can revive infinitely, it is advised to either bring [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] (which the aforementioned anti-Zombie units all possess) or to have [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] that can slip by before he revives, such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]]. Landing the finishing blow with a Zombie Killer is of utmost importance before Zyclone becomes a prominent threat, especially in [[Revenge of the Unholy (Merciless)|Revenge of the Unholy]], where three of them spawn.

If you have [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]] units, [[Sarukani (Uber Rare Cat)|Sarukani]], [[Bunny & Canard (Uber Rare Cat)|Disciple Psychoduck]] or other good [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]], Zyclone becomes much easier to deal with, as they all have good anti-Zombie abilities that can be put to great use.

