==Trivia==
*Since he has bones in his vortex, was formed from the gathered spirits of those defeated by the Battle Cats, and is nearly unbeatable without [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]], Zyclone may have been inspired by ''[[wikipedia:Gashadokuro|Gashadokuro]]'', a nigh-indestructible skeletal ''[[wikipedia:Yōkai|yōkai]]'' formed from the gathered bones of those who died in battle or of starvation/famine without being buried.
*The repetition of the digit 4 in his stats refers to how the kanji for four (四) and the kanji for death (死) can both be read as ''shi''.
*He is the first [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemy to have more than 1 revive.
*He has the highest DPS of all Zombies and is tied with his nephew [[Li'l Zyclone]] for the fastest attack rate of all Zombies.
*As Li'l Zyclone's uncle, Zyclone is the only full-sized [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] to have a confirmed gender.
*He and Li'l Zyclone are the only Cyclones to have a moving eye, as well as the only Cyclones who do not blink.
*Prior to [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]], Zyclone was limited to reviving 99 times.

